"text":"Automated laboratories"},{"text":"High-throughput screening"},{"text":"Biomanufacturing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile will combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Wet Lab","Computational Biology","Statistics","AI/Data Science"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the Role Evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"AI and laboratory automation will increasingly assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Literature analysis"},{"text":"Target identification"},{"text":"Experimental design"},{"text":"Protein structure prediction"},{"text":"Drug candidate screening"},{"text":"Genomic analysis"},{"text":"Image analysis"},{"text":"High-throughput experimentation"},{"text":"Biomarker discovery"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But researchers will still need to handle:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Experimental validation"},{"text":"Biological interpretation"},{"text":"Experimental troubleshooting"},{"text":"Research strategy"},{"text":"Reproducibility"},{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"Translational research"},{"text":"Scientific decision-making"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The future Research Associate is therefore likely to become:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Experimental Biologist","Computational Researcher","AI-assisted Scientist"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Biological Foundation"},{"type":"flow","items":["Cell Biology","Genetics","Molecular Biology","Biochemistry","Microbiology"]},{"type":"h","text":"Laboratory"},{"type":"flow","items":["PCR/qPCR","DNA/RNA","Cell Culture","Protein Analysis","Experimental Techniques"]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"flow","items":["Experimental Design","Biostatistics","Literature Review","Scientific Writing","Reproducibility"]},{"type":"h","text":"Computational"},{"type":"flow","items":["Python/R","Bioinformatics","Genomics","Data Analysis","Machine Learning"]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"flow","items":["CRISPR","Synthetic Biology","Single-Cell/Omics","AI for Biology","Automated Research"]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile"},{"type":"flow","items":["Biotechnology Researcher","Molecular Biology Specialist","Bioinformatics/AI-enabled Scientist"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For this particular career, the biggest differentiator is research evidence: meaningful laboratory projects, research internships, publications/posters where appropriate, strong experimental skills and eventually postgraduate research—not simply the number of biotechnology certificates collected."}]}]}